        "data": {
          "title": "Privacy",
          "excerpt": "Your details",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "paragraph",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "span",
                  "text": "We use your name, email address and any art form or message only to handle your request. If you separately choose updates, we also use your email for Atelier 4 news. Your application and artist profile are not automatically made public. You can request access, correction or deletion at contact@ateliervier.be. The website and data are processed through Cloudflare. We use OpenPanel visitor statistics only with your consent; form details are not shared with analytics. We retain requests until handled, for at most 12 months, and update subscriptions until you unsubscribe. Functional session cookies protect the CMS. Atelier 4 is still taking shape; contact us with questions about this processing.",
